H8520.def:
A man of the tribe of Ephraim living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 7:25; 
son of: Resheph (H7566); 
father of: Tahan (H8465H) 
§ Telah = "vigour"
a son of Ephraim

H8526G.def:
A man living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Nombres 13:22; 
son of: Anak (H6061); 
brother of: Ahiman (H0289) and Sheshai (H8344)
§ Talmai = "furrowed"
1) one of the 3 sons of the giant Anak who were slain by the men of Judah
2) son of Ammihud, king of Geshur, later king of Geshur himself, and father of Maacah, the mother of Absalom and wife of David

H8526H.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 3:3; 
son of: Ammihud (H5989J); 
father of: Maacah (H4601I)
§ Talmai = "furrowed"
1) one of the 3 sons of the giant Anak who were slain by the men of Judah
2) son of Ammihud, king of Geshur, later king of Geshur himself, and father of Maacah, the mother of Absalom and wife of David

H8583.def:
A man living at the time of United Monarchy, first mentioned at 2 Samuel 8:9; 
father of: Joram (H3141); also called Tou at 1 Chroniques 18:9,10; 
§ Toi or Tou = "wander"
king of Hamath in the time of David

H8599A.def:
A man of the tribe of Judah living at the time of Divided Monarchy, only mentioned at 1 Chroniques 2:43; 
son of: Hebron (H2275I); 
brother of: Korah (H7141J), Rekem (H7552I) and Shema (H8087)
§ Tappuah = "the apple city"
a Judaite of the family of Caleb, son of Hebron
